  "description": "Variation of Conditions 2 (approved drawings) and 7 of the planning permission reference: 2024/00632/FUL dated 17th February 2025 for the \"Amalgamation of the existing 2no. self-contained flats (lower ground floor and upper floor levels) into a single dwellinghouse; erection of a single storey rear extension, following the demolition of existing two storey rear extension; enclosing the front room with a brick wall and a canopy above, at lower ground floor level; replacement of an existing rooflight with a new dormer window in the front roofslope; installation of a new enlarged dormer window to replace existing, and installation of 1no. rooflight in the side roofslope; installation of new windows to replace all existing, to the front and rear elevations; associated external alterations.\" Amendments sought to Condition 2 to include changing the material finish on the flat roof extension to a single ply membrane with standing seam profile and the installation of 2 no. skylights, alterations to lower ground rear elevation to include installation of double door to the bedroom in lieu of the previously proposed window and adjacent window blank recess, re-sizing and repositioning of the dormer window on the western roofslope, and amendment to the wording of Condition 7 (Amended Description).",
